FILE_DESCRIPTION(
/* description */ (
'Clamping nut for the elevation pulley. Internal M32x1, MetricFor3DPri
nt class Gap-0.2, threaded to the open face and then countersunk so th
e entry carries partial threads instead of a blank lip. Skirt OD 47, 0.
7 mm clamping bead. Local origin on the bead face, axis = X.'),
/* implementation_level */ '2;1');

